# The optimization program's speculative rounds (O3 of ~/.cache/kosa-dev/flatshare-opt), round 1 of 2, on Phastform, on a
# fresh sample of the agents (seed 36): the configuration to deploy with the program's optimizations against the same
# with speculative decoding (the opt-*-spec arms), paired, beside 24 session trees of the discriminating scenario with 2
# and 4 callers.
#   FLATSHARE_GPU=NODE benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh --pause benchmarks/e2/opt-s1.campaign

agents-seed 36

# engine make-room, the program's optimizations, then with speculative decoding
arms/opt-disc-ret-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-spec-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-ret-c4-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-spec-c4-s24.toml
